        "key_takeaways": {
          "en": [
            "Orchard is an open-source framework.",
            "It enables the research community to train and evaluate AI agents across different task types.",
            "The framework is designed to reduce complexity and support strong performance from smaller models by facilitating infrastructure reuse."
          ],
          "zh": [
            "Orchard是一个开源框架。",
            "它使研究社区能够跨不同任务类型训练和评估AI代理。",
